# Problem 8 – Reverse a Number

### Code

```python
def reverse_number(n):
    if n == 0:
        return
    print(n % 10, end="")
    reverse_number(n // 10)

reverse_number(1234)
```

### Output

```
4321
```

### Logic

Print the last digit first, then recursively process the remaining digits.

