# Problem 9 – Sum of Digits

### Code

```python
def sum_digit(n):
    if n == 0:
        return 0
    return (n % 10) + sum_digit(n // 10)

print(sum_digit(1234))
```

### Output

```
10
```

### Logic

Extract the last digit and add it to the recursive sum of the remaining digits.

